# Project Guidelines

## Documentation
- Update relevant docs when modifying features
- Keep README.md in sync with new capabilities
- When in plan mode, always include a first step to write the plan to a plan.md in the workspace.

## Coding
- minimize external dependencies, they increase our security risk surface
- prefer simple idioms over elaborate constructions
- explain non-tivial code with comments

## Testing
- Unit tests are required for all scripting
- Integration tests for game mechanics is desired
- working code over test coverage
